        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>  DEF-012: verify_csrf() in bootstrap.php sets HTTP 419, which Apache does not recognise and rewrites to 500 Internal Server Error. The CSRF block itself works, but it surfaces as a server error and the 'The form expired' message is lost. Use 403 Forbidden instead.&#xD;
